<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n21566" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γᾰμ-ικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of</i> or <i>for marriage</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νόμοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					721a
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γ. ὁμιλία</span>
			<i>connubial</i> intercourse, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pol.</u>
				1334b32
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γ. ὑμέναιος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pherecr.
					12
				</span></i>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				D.
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γ. ὕμνος</span> a
			<i>bridal</i> song, Hippoloch. ap. <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				4.130a
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Porph.
				<u>Marc.</u>
				2
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συγγραφή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>POxy.</u>
					1473.25
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iii A. D.)</span>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ γ.</span>
			<i>bridal, wedding</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				2.15
			</span></i>; <i>questions of marriage-rights</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				6.6
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pol.</u>
				1304a14
			</span></i>. Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κῶς ἑστιᾶν</span> feast <i>as at a
				wedding</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>EN</u>
				1123a22
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γαμικόν, τό</span>, <i>marriage-contract,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				POxy.
				903.17
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iv A. D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> of persons, <i>of marriageable age,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Epigr.Gr.
				288.7
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Cyprus</span>): pr. n. in <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				14.496
			</span></i>.</div>
